        ecrm:P126_employed      "Silk taffeta. \nPekin weave with watered, gros de tours borders shaded from light to dark at edges. A light silk satin stripe separates the watered edge and centre ground of plain taffeta weave. Weft looped at edge. The bouquet of flowers made of ten different coloured flushing warp threads, the floats of which have been cut away between each bouquet."@en ;
